    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d320">

                <pb facs="0491" n="177" xml:id="pg177"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/629</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Austro-Hungarian Ambassador</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Dumba</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Austro-Hungarian Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Manchester, Massachusetts</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1914-08-26">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">August 26, 1914</hi>.</date>
                    <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 4 p.m.</hi>] </dateline>
                <p rendition="#center">[Telegram]</p>
                <p>I have just been informed by wireless by my Government that Emperor has ordered
                    Commander of Austrian cruiser <hi rendition="#italic">Elizabeth</hi> in Tsingtao
                    to take up fight together with German Navy. Our diplomatic relations with Japan
                    are broken off.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dumba</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
